<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>VS Code Web Prototype v3</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #1e1e1e;
      --bg-elev: #252526;
      --bg-elev-2: #2d2d30;
      --bg-elev-3: #333333;
      --bg-title: #181818;
      --line: #3c3c3c;
      --text: #cccccc;
      --muted: #8c8c8c;
      --accent: #007acc;
      --accent-2: #0e639c;
      --ok: #73c991;
      --warn: #dcdcaa;
      --err: #f48771;
      --shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.38);
      --activity-width: 48px;
      --sidebar-width: 300px;
      --panel-height: 230px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: Inter, Segoe UI, system-ui, sans-serif; }
    button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }
    body { overflow: hidden; }

    .app {
      height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: 32px 1fr 24px;
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .titlebar {
      background: var(--bg-title);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 10px;
      gap: 10px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 20;
    }
    .menus { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; }
    .menu-wrap { position: relative; }
    .menu-btn {
      background: transparent; color: var(--text); border: 0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px 10px; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .menu-btn:hover, .menu-btn.active { background: var(--bg-elev-3); color: #fff; }
    .menu-dropdown {
      position: absolute; top: 30px; left: 0; min-width: 220px; background: var(--bg-elev);
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); display: none; overflow: hidden; z-index: 50;
    }
    .menu-dropdown.open { display: block; }
    .menu-item {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
      padding: 9px 12px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    }
    .menu-item:hover { background: var(--bg-elev-3); }
    .menu-shortcut { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    .window-title { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); user-select: none; }
    .title-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
    .title-chip {
      font-size: 11px; color: #fff; background: var(--accent-2); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .workbench {
      min-height: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: var(--activity-width) var(--sidebar-width) 4px 1fr;
      transition: grid-template-columns .15s ease;
    }
    .activitybar {
      background: var(--bg-title);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding-top: 8px;
    }
    .activity-btn {
      width: 36px; height: 36px; border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--muted);
      border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; position: relative; font-size: 18px;
    }
    .activity-btn:hover, .activity-btn.active { background: var(--bg-elev-2); color: #fff; }
    .activity-btn.active::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; left: -8px; top: 5px; bottom: 5px; width: 3px; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 99px;
    }
    .activity-spacer { flex: 1; }

    .sidebar {
      background: var(--bg-elev);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      min-width: 180px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    }
    .sidebar.hidden { display: none; }
    .sidebar-header {
      height: 36px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 12px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff;
    }
    .sidebar-body { min-height: 0; overflow: auto; padding: 10px; }

    .section { display: none; }
    .section.active { display: block; }

    .resizer {
      cursor: col-resize; background: transparent; position: relative;
    }
    .resizer:hover::after, .resizer.dragging::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0 1px; background: var(--accent);
    }

    .editor-area {
      min-width: 0; min-height: 0; display: grid; grid-template-rows: 35px 1fr 4px var(--panel-height);
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    .tabs {
      background: var(--bg-title); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: stretch; overflow-x: auto; overflow-y: hidden;
    }
    .tab {
      min-width: 140px; max-width: 240px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; background: var(--bg-elev); border-right: 1px solid var(--line); cursor: pointer;
      border-top: 2px solid transparent;
    }
    .tab.active { background: #1f1f1f; color: #fff; border-top-color: var(--accent); }
    .tab-left { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    .tab-close { background: transparent; border: 0; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; }
    .tab-close:hover { color: #fff; }

    .editor-stack {
      min-height: 0; position: relative; background: var(--bg);
    }
    .editor-view { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: none; }
    .editor-view.active { display: block; }
    .editor-empty {
      position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;
    }

    .panel-resizer { cursor: row-resize; position: relative; }
    .panel-resizer:hover::after, .panel-resizer.dragging::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 1px 0; background: var(--accent);
    }

    .bottom-panel {
      background: var(--bg-title); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); min-height: 120px; display: grid; grid-template-rows: 34px 1fr 40px;
    }
    .bottom-panel.hidden { display: none; }
    .panel-header {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; padding: 0 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: #202020;
    }
    .panel-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
    .panel-tab { font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); }
    .panel-tab.active { color: #fff; background: var(--bg-elev-2); }
    .panel-tools { display: flex; gap: 8px; }

    .terminal-output {
      overflow: auto; padding: 10px 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.55; background: #181818;
    }
    .line { white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .line.system { color: #9cdcfe; }
    .line.ok { color: var(--ok); }
    .line.warn { color: var(--warn); }
    .line.err { color: var(--err); }

    .terminal-input-row {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 8px; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 8px 12px;
      background: #151515;
    }
    .prompt {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; color: var(--ok);
    }
    .terminal-input {
      width: 100%; background: #101010; color: #fff; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; outline: none;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    }

    .statusbar {
      background: var(--accent); color: #fff; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 0 10px; font-size: 12px;
    }
    .status-left, .status-right { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; }
    .status-item { white-space: nowrap; cursor: pointer; }

    .toolbar { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn, .input, .select {
      border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg-elev-2); color: var(--text); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px;
    }
    .btn { cursor: pointer; }
    .btn:hover { background: #3a3a3d; }
    .btn.danger:hover { background: #7c2a2a; }
    .input, .select { width: 100%; }
    .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    .row-card {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .row-card:hover { background: var(--bg-elev-3); }
    .row-main { min-width: 0; }
    .row-title { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    .row-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    .tag { font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: #163b52; color: #9cdcfe; white-space: nowrap; }
    .tree-children { margin-left: 14px; border-left: 1px dashed #454545; padding-left: 10px; }

    .palette {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.4); display: none; place-items: start center; padding-top: 10vh; z-index: 100;
    }
    .palette.open { display: grid; }
    .palette-card {
      width: min(720px, 92vw); background: var(--bg-elev); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); overflow: hidden;
    }
    .palette-input {
      width: 100%; border: 0; outline: none; background: #1f1f1f; color: #fff; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 15px;
    }
    .palette-list { max-height: 420px; overflow: auto; }
    .palette-item { padding: 12px 16px; cursor: pointer; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
    .palette-item:hover, .palette-item.active { background: var(--bg-elev-3); }
    .palette-item small { color: var(--muted); }

    .toast-wrap {
      position: fixed; right: 16px; bottom: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; z-index: 120;
    }
    .toast {
      background: #252526; border: 1px solid var(--line); color: #fff; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); min-width: 240px;
    }

    .context-menu {
      position: fixed; background: var(--bg-elev); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); z-index: 130; min-width: 160px; display: none;
    }
    .context-menu.open { display: block; }
    .ctx-item { padding: 8px 12px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; }
    .ctx-item:hover { background: var(--bg-elev-3); }
    .ctx-sep { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin: 4px 0; }

    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.5); display: none; place-items: center; z-index: 140;
    }
    .modal-overlay.open { display: grid; }
    .modal-card {
      background: var(--bg-elev); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; width: min(400px, 90vw); box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .modal-title { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 16px; }
    .modal-input { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .modal-actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; }

    .settings-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .settings-row label { font-size: 13px; }

    .hidden { display: none !important; }

    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .workbench { grid-template-columns: var(--activity-width) minmax(220px, 38vw) 4px 1fr; }
      .window-title { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app">
    <div class="titlebar">
      <div class="menus" id="menus"></div>
      <div class="window-title">VS Code Web Prototype v3 · Monaco + Terminal + IndexedDB</div>
      <div class="title-actions">
        <span class="title-chip" id="monacoState">Monaco: loading...</span>
        <span class="title-chip">Offline-ready</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="workbench" id="workbench">
      <aside class="activitybar" id="activitybar"></aside>

      <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-header">
          <span id="sidebarTitle">Explorer</span>
          <button class="btn" id="toggleSidebarBtn" title="Hide sidebar">×</button>
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-body">
          <section class="section active" data-section="explorer">
            <div class="toolbar">
              <button class="btn" id="newFileBtn">+ New File</button>
              <button class="btn" id="newFolderBtn">+ Folder</button>
              <button class="btn" id="openDirBtn" title="Open real folder">📂 Open Dir</button>
            </div>
            <div id="fileTree"></div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" data-section="search">
            <input class="input" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search in files" />
            <div class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 10px;">Live search across workspace</div>
            <div id="searchResults"></div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" data-section="scm">
            <div class="toolbar">
              <button class="btn" id="stageAllBtn">Stage All</button>
              <button class="btn" id="commitBtn">Commit</button>
            </div>
            <div id="scmList"></div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" data-section="debug">
            <div class="toolbar">
              <button class="btn" id="runBtn">Run</button>
              <button class="btn" id="toggleBpBtn">Breakpoint</button>
            </div>
            <div id="debugList"></div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" data-section="extensions">
            <input class="input" id="extSearchInput" placeholder="Search extensions" />
            <div class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 10px;">Install, enable, disable extensions</div>
            <div id="extensionsList"></div>
          </section>

          <section class="section" data-section="settings">
            <div class="muted" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Editor Settings</div>
            <div id="settingsList"></div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="resizer" id="sidebarResizer" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <main class="editor-area">
        <div class="tabs" id="tabs"></div>
        <div class="editor-stack" id="editorStack">
          <div class="editor-empty" id="editorEmpty">No file open</div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-resizer" id="panelResizer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <section class="bottom-panel" id="bottomPanel">
          <div class="panel-header">
            <div class="panel-tabs">
              <div class="panel-tab active">TERMINAL</div>
              <div class="panel-tab">PROBLEMS</div>
              <div class="panel-tab">OUTPUT</div>
            </div>
            <div class="panel-tools">
              <button class="btn" id="clearTerminalBtn">Clear</button>
              <button class="btn" id="hideTerminalBtn">Hide</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-output" id="terminalOutput"></div>
          <div class="terminal-input-row">
            <div class="prompt" id="terminalPrompt">user@webide:~$</div>
            <input class="terminal-input" id="terminalInput" placeholder="Type a command" />
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>

    <div class="statusbar">
      <div class="status-left">
        <span class="status-item" id="statusBranch">⎇ main</span>
        <span class="status-item" id="statusFiles">Files: 0</span>
        <span class="status-item" id="statusMode">Mode: Editor</span>
        <span class="status-item" id="statusCursor">Ln 1, Col 1</span>
      </div>
      <div class="status-right">
        <span class="status-item" id="statusLanguage">Plain Text</span>
        <span class="status-item">UTF-8</span>
        <span class="status-item">LF</span>
        <span class="status-item" id="statusClock"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="palette" id="palette">
    <div class="palette-card">
      <input class="palette-input" id="paletteInput" placeholder="Type a command or file name" />
      <div class="palette-list" id="paletteList"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="context-menu" id="contextMenu">
    <div class="ctx-item" data-action="rename">Rename</div>
    <div class="ctx-item" data-action="duplicate">Duplicate</div>
    <div class="ctx-sep"></div>
    <div class="ctx-item" data-action="delete" style="color:var(--err)">Delete</div>
  </div>

  <div class="modal-overlay" id="modalOverlay">
    <div class="modal-card">
      <h3 class="modal-title" id="modalTitle">Input</h3>
      <input class="input modal-input" id="modalInput" />
      <div class="modal-actions">
        <button class="btn" id="modalCancel">Cancel</button>
        <button class="btn" id="modalOk" style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)">OK</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="toast-wrap" id="toastWrap"></div>

  <script>
    // ===================== Service Worker (inline) =====================
    const swCode = `
      self.addEventListener('install', e => self.skipWaiting());
      self.addEventListener('activate', e => e.waitUntil(self.clients.claim()));
      self.addEventListener('fetch', e => e.respondWith(fetch(e.request).catch(() => new Response('Offline', {status: 503}))));
    `;
    if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
      const blob = new Blob([swCode], { type: 'application/javascript' });
      navigator.serviceWorker.register(URL.createObjectURL(blob)).catch(() => {});
    }

    // ===================== Utilities =====================
    const DB_NAME = 'vscode-web-prototype-v3';
    const STORE = 'state';
    let db;
    let monacoReady = false;
    let monacoLoadStarted = false;
    const editors = new Map();
    const models = new Map();
    let paletteIndex = 0;
    let paletteItemsCache = [];
    let searchDebounce = null;
    let ctxTarget = null;

    function $(sel) { return document.querySelector(sel); }
    function $all(sel) { return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(sel)); }
    function uid(prefix='id') { return prefix + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 9); }
    function escapeHtml(str) {
      return String(str).replace(/[&<>"']/g, ch => ({ '&':'&amp;', '<':'&lt;', '>':'&gt;', '"':'&quot;', "'":'&#39;' }[ch]));
    }
    function activeFile() { return state.files.find(f => f.id === state.activeFileId) || null; }
    function humanLang(id) {
      const map = { javascript: 'JavaScript', typescript: 'TypeScript', html: 'HTML', css: 'CSS', json: 'JSON', markdown: 'Markdown', python: 'Python', plaintext: 'Plain Text' };
      return map[id] || id;
    }
    function deepMerge(target, source) {
      const out = structuredClone(target);
      for (const key in source) {
        if (source[key] && typeof source[key] === 'object' && !Array.isArray(source[key])) {
          out[key] = deepMerge(out[key] || {}, source[key]);
        } else {
          out[key] = source[key];
        }
      }
      return out;
    }
    function limitArr(arr, max) { return arr.slice(-max); }

    // ===================== Default State =====================
    const defaultState = {
      activeSection: 'explorer',
      activeFileId: 'f-app',
      sidebarVisible: true,
      terminalVisible: true,
      claudeMode: false,
      cwd: '/',
      commandHistory: [],
      historyIndex: -1,
      sidebarWidth: 300,
      panelHeight: 230,
      breakpoints: [],
      scmLog: ['Initial scaffold imported'],
      settings: { fontSize: 14, wordWrap: 'on', minimap: true, theme: 'vs-dark' },
      folders: [
        { id: 'd-root', name: 'workspace', expanded: true },
        { id: 'd-src', name: 'src', expanded: true }
      ],
      extensions: [
        { id: 'prettier', name: 'Prettier', installed: true, enabled: true },
        { id: 'eslint', name: 'ESLint', installed: true, enabled: true },
        { id: 'gitlens', name: 'GitLens', installed: false, enabled: false },
        { id: 'material-theme', name: 'Material Theme', installed: false, enabled: false },
        { id: 'markdown-all-in-one', name: 'Markdown All in One', installed: false, enabled: false }
      ],
      files: [
        {
          id: 'f-app', parentId: 'd-src', name: 'app.js', language: 'javascript', changed: false,
          content: `const state = {
  project: 'VS Code Web Prototype v3',
  goals: ['monaco', 'tabs', 'search', 'terminal', 'indexeddb', 'filesystem']
};

function start() {
  console.log('Booting prototype', state);
}

start();`
        },
        {
          id: 'f-index', parentId: 'd-root', name: 'index.html', language: 'html', changed: false,
          content: `<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Prototype v3</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="app"></div>
    <script src="app.js"><\/script>
  </body>
</html>`
        },
        {
          id: 'f-style', parentId: 'd-src', name: 'styles.css', language: 'css', changed: false,
          content: `:root { --accent: #007acc; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: #1e1e1e;
  color: #d4d4d4;
  font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
}`
        },
        {
          id: 'f-readme', parentId: 'd-root', name: 'README.md', language: 'markdown', changed: false,
          content: `# VS Code Web Prototype v3

- Monaco editor via CDN
- Multi-tab editing with real folder tree
- Search panel (debounced)
- Source control simulation
- Terminal with Claude mode
- IndexedDB persistence
- File System Access API support
- Settings panel`
        }
      ],
      claudeTranscript: []
    };

    let state = structuredClone(defaultState);

    const activityItems = [
      { key: 'explorer', icon: '📁', label: 'Explorer' },
      { key: 'search', icon: '🔎', label: 'Search' },
      { key: 'scm', icon: '⑂', label: 'Source Control' },
      { key: 'debug', icon: '▶', label: 'Run & Debug' },
      { key: 'extensions', icon: '🧩', label: 'Extensions' },
      { key: 'settings', icon: '⚙', label: 'Settings' }
    ];

    const menuConfig = {
      File: [
        ['New File', 'Ctrl+N'],
        ['Open Folder', ''],
        ['Save', 'Ctrl+S'],
        ['Save All', ''],
        ['Preferences', '']
      ],
      Edit: [
        ['Undo', 'Ctrl+Z'],
        ['Redo', 'Ctrl+Y'],
        ['Cut', 'Ctrl+X'],
        ['Copy', 'Ctrl+C'],
        ['Paste', 'Ctrl+V'],
        ['Find in Files', 'Ctrl+P']
      ],
      Selection: [
        ['Select All', 'Ctrl+A'],
        ['Expand Selection', 'Alt+Shift+→'],
        ['Shrink Selection', 'Alt+Shift+←']
      ],
      View: [
        ['Toggle Sidebar', 'Ctrl+B'],
        ['Toggle Terminal', 'Ctrl+`'],
        ['Command Palette', 'Ctrl+Shift+P'],
        ['Zoom In', ''],
        ['Zoom Out', '']
      ],
      Go: [
        ['Go to File', 'Ctrl+P'],
        ['Go to Symbol', ''],
        ['Go to Line', 'Ctrl+G'],
        ['Go to Definition', 'F12']
      ],
      Run: [
        ['Run Active File', 'F5'],
        ['Start Debugging', ''],
        ['Toggle Breakpoint', 'F9']
      ],
      Terminal: [
        ['New Terminal', ''],
        ['Clear Terminal', ''],
        ['Run Task', '']
      ],
      Help: [
        ['Welcome', ''],
        ['Keyboard Shortcuts', ''],
        ['About Prototype', '']
      ]
    };

    const commandPaletteActions = [
